// The freighter's pallet, as the studio's model has it (Chris Trice's photographs on Starship Modeler, cited, not
// reproduced): a flat bed as long and wide as the passenger module, its deck finely ribbed along its length with a
// lip along either side, a raised block across each end, and standing at each end a truss shaped like a trapezoid
// seen end on -- its legs leaning in from the deck's edges to a bar under the spine's bottom chords, a long diagonal
// from either side to the middle of that bar, a bar across where they cross the middle of the height, and a short
// strut from each end of that down to the deck -- by which the pallet hangs.  Under it, ribs along and across, a
// round foot near each corner and a square pad on a post further in, down to 0.92.  Its cargo is a scene's to load.
